      "content": "If he remains unresponsive or \"loopy\" after taking the combination, you should definitely wake him up and try a sip of cold water to check for confusion.\nA lingering 103-degree fever with altered mental status is a sign that the body is still fighting hard, and forcing him to sleep won't help if he's not recovering.\nHowever, if he truly cannot be roused or his breathing changes, you must call the doctor immediately because this could be something more serious than a simple post-viral crash.",
